DESCRIPTION: High Voltage Fairies in the Pit – 1 Year Anniversary! 🥳 Celebrate 1 year of the Fairy Pit with us at Viper Room! HIGH VOLTAGE style: Nu & Alt Metal\, Metalcore & DnB. One pit to rule them all: no rules\, just riffs & nasty bass drops. Back by popular request\, DJ Rosi\, this time joined on the decks by your very own Veranstalterin\, Fairy Mary! Get ready for the craziest\, wildest Fairy Pit yet! Neon rave style: Trixidal is back with fire UV makeup looks for you! We heard you 🫶 Vienna’s only Metal & DnB Party ⚡🔥💀 🎧🔥 DJ Rosi 🎧🔥 DJ Fairy Mary 🔊 Sounds Like: Linkin Park | Electric Callboy | Bring Me the Horizon | Motionless in White | Architects | I Prevail | Polaris | Nothing More | Escape the Fate | Bad Omens | BABYMETAL | Poppy | In This Moment | Beartooth | Falling in Reverse | Avenged Sevenfold | Rise Against | Parkway Drive | A Day to Remember | Ice Nine Kills | Enter Shikari | Landmvrks | Lorna Shore | Bullet for My Valentine | Slipknot | System of a Down | Skindred | Limp Bizkit | Papa Roach | Breaking Benjamin | Three Days Grace | Korn | Godsmack | P.O.D | Static-X | Shinedown | Hollywood Undead | Disturbed | Deftones | My Chemical Romance | Black Veil Brides | The Offspring | Sum 41 | Paramore | Evanescence | Pierce the Veil | Asking Alexandria | Thousand Foot Krutch | Pendulum | Chase & Status | The Prodigy | The Qemists | Solence | Zardonic | Kanine | Camo & Krooked | Dimension | Sub Focus | Culture Shock | Mefjus | Noisia | Insideinfo | Pythius | Freaks & Geeks | Kritikal | Riot 🤌 Goodies: 🧚‍♀️💙 Fairy Juice = Gratis Eintritts-Shots 🥃 😌✨ UV-Makup Station 🖤💜 👑 Knicklichtern & LED-Kronen 💖💫 🛍️ Merch Stand: wearing merch at our events gets you ½ Entry! VVK: €7 | Door: €10 | €6 als Fee/mit HVF-Merch  
